      <h1>Tribes & Culture of Zanzibar & Tanzania</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Discover the rich cultural tapestry of Tanzania's 120+ tribes. From the Maasai of the Serengeti to the Swahili coastal culture of Zanzibar — explore traditions, ceremonies, and authentic community experiences.</p>
